     "md": "Level 4/unit 1/unit 1.md",
     "mdText": "[HEADER] unit 1 — CD1\n\n[1] Conversation — track 1, 3, 4\nKevin: Amy, what are you doing this vacation?\nAmy: I **wanted to** go to Hawaii, but it's kind of expensive.\nKevin: That's true.\nAmy: So I'm staying here. Besides, I **need to** go to summer school. My grades aren't very good.\nKevin: Are you going to study all summer, then?\nAmy: No, not *all* summer. I **have to** relax, too, you know.\n\n[2] Speak Like a Native — track 2\n1. What are you doing this vacation?\nsmooth: “What are you”\nchange: “What‿are” (t → d)\n“What are you” đọc liền mạch với nhau.\nChữ “t” của từ “what” phát âm là “d” và nối với từ “are”.\n\n2. I wanted to go to Hawaii, but it's kind of expensive.\nsmooth: “wanted to go to”\nchange: “but‿it's” (t → d)\nlinking: “kind‿of”\n“Wanted to go to” đọc liền mạch với nhau.\nChữ “t” của từ “but” phát âm là “d” và nối với từ “it's”.\n“Kind of” nối với nhau và đọc liền mạch.\n\n3. My grades aren't very good.\nsmooth: “grades aren't”, “very good”\nweak: “aren't”\nChữ “t” của từ “aren't” hầu như không phát âm ra.\nNgoài ra, từ “grades aren't” và “very good” đọc liền mạch với nhau.\n\n[3] Study Notes\n\n[4] Grammar Focus\nwant to (tôi muốn)\nI [[want to]] buy a new computer.\nI [[want to]] see you again soon.\n\nneed to (tôi cần)\nI [[need to]] send this package by express mail.\nYou [[need to]] show your ID here.\n\nhave to (tôi phải)\nI [[have to]] get up early tomorrow.\nShe [[has to]] finish the report today.\n\n[5] Role Play — track 6\nA: Amy, what are you doing this vacation?\nB: I wanted to ________, but it's kind of expensive.\nA: That's true.\nB: So I'm staying here. Besides, I need to ________. My grades aren't very good.\nA: Are you going to study all summer, then?\nB: No, not all summer. I have to ________, you know.\n\n[6] Substitution Drill — track 7\n1. I wanted to __go to Hawaii__, but it's kind of expensive.\na. visit Niagara Falls\nb. fly to L.A.\nc. take a road trip across the country\n\n2. Besides, I need to __go to summer school__.\na. catch up on studying\nb. get some tutoring\nc. start reading for the next semester\n\n3. I have to __relax, too__, you know.\na. take a break sometime\nb. work on my suntan, too\nc. make some time for fun\n",
